{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "five-forces",
  "displayName": "5フォース分析",
  "pack": "analysis",
  "category": "macro",
  "description": "業界の競争構造を 5 つの力（業界内競争・新規参入・代替品・買い手・売り手）で評価する",
  "answers": ["この業界の競争圧力はどこから来ていて、どの程度強いのか"],
  "inferenceLevel": "strategic",
  "compatibleLayouts": ["BLANK"],
  "example": "example.json",
  "slots": {
    "title": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 70},
    "rivalry": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 36},
    "entrants": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 40},
    "substitutes": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 40},
    "buyers": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 36},
    "suppliers": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 36},
    "source": {"type": "string", "required": true, "maxLength": 160}
  },
  "guardrails": [
    "各力は「強 / 中 / 弱：根拠」の形で書く（評価だけ・根拠だけにしない）。title が結論（どの力が収益性を最も圧迫するか）を担う",
    "どの業界（市場の範囲）の話かを title か source に明記する。範囲が変わると評価も変わる",
    "5 つの力は業界構造の記述。自社固有の強み・弱みは書かない（swot-analysis へ）",
    "評価は評価者の判断を含む。評価の根拠資料と評価日を source に書く",
    "中央（業界内の競争）は他の 4 つの力の結果でもある。因果の矢印はこの図では主張しない"
  ],
  "slide": {
    "layout": "BLANK",
    "figures": [
      {"type": "governing_message", "x": 0.5, "y": 0.42, "w": 9.0, "text": {"$slot": "title"}},
      {"type": "cards", "x": 3.4, "y": 1.05, "w": 3.2, "h": 1.03, "titleSize": 10.5, "bodySize": 9,
       "items": [["新規参入の脅威", {"$slot": "entrants"}]]},
      {"type": "cards", "x": 0.5, "y": 2.18, "w": 2.85, "h": 1.03, "titleSize": 10.5, "bodySize": 9,
       "items": [["売り手の交渉力", {"$slot": "suppliers"}]]},
      {"type": "cards", "x": 3.57, "y": 2.18, "w": 2.86, "h": 1.03, "titleSize": 10.5, "bodySize": 9,
       "items": [["業界内の競争", {"$slot": "rivalry"}]]},
      {"type": "cards", "x": 6.65, "y": 2.18, "w": 2.85, "h": 1.03, "titleSize": 10.5, "bodySize": 9,
       "items": [["買い手の交渉力", {"$slot": "buyers"}]]},
      {"type": "cards", "x": 3.4, "y": 3.31, "w": 3.2, "h": 1.03, "titleSize": 10.5, "bodySize": 9,
       "items": [["代替品の脅威", {"$slot": "substitutes"}]]},
      {"type": "source_note", "x": 0.5, "y": 4.87, "w": 9.0, "source": {"$slot": "source"}}
    ]
  }
}
